<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Dell shares rise.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Dell shares rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dell Computer Corp rose shortly after the company said its October quarter sales rose 43 percent, to more than $2 billion.</p>
<p>Dell said its quarterly earnings were $1.56 per share, excluding a $0.04 per share charge, compared with $0.75 per share last year.</p>
<p>The company's shares jumped 1-7/8 after hours to 90-1/2.</p>
<p>During regular market hours, the shares fell 1-3/4 to 88-5/8.</p>
</text>
